    Backstab --- BSCrit
    Flurry --> SI
    SI --- SICrit
    SI --> TC
    TC --- TCCD
    TC --- TCDmg
    TC --- TCAuto
    Backstab --> DF
    DF --- DFTurn
    DF --- DFCombo3

    OutAmbush["← from CENTER (Ambush):<br/>stun synergy"]:::out
    OutPS["← from LEFT (Pocket Sand):<br/>blind → backstab"]:::out
    OutShadow["→ to Shadowblade tree:<br/>dual-wield combo scaling"]:::out

    OutAmbush -. " feeds " .-> FlStun
    OutPS -. " feeds " .-> Backstab
    Flurry -. " edge bridge " .-> OutShadow

    classDef active fill:#5b3b6a,stroke:#a78bfa,stroke-width:3px,color:#fff
